{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46832","headline":"寄孙鲂秀才 · 齐己","name":"寄孙鲂秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡楼东面寺墙西，颜子生涯竹屋低。\n书案飞扬风落絮，地苔狼藉燕衔泥。\n吟窗晚凭春篁密，行径斜穿夏菜齐。\n别後相思频梦到，二年同此赋闲题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}